    "body": "### Describe your issue\n\nThere is a GHA action for continuous benchmarking that collects results and visualizes changes over time.\nhttps://github.com/benchmark-action/github-action-benchmark\n\nInvestigate if there is a way to integrate it with our benchmark runner, e.g. by adapting the result output.\nIf so, set up a benchmarking workflow that uses it.",
